OL,3,GNEWSANorthamptonshire Day postponed due
OL,4,Ato high winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral events have been cancelled in
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire due to forecast high
OL,8,Fwinds.
OL,10,FMore than 50 organisations had been due
OL,11,Fto take part in Northamptonshire Day,
OL,12,Fcelebrating the county's heritage, in
OL,13,FKettering on Sunday.
OL,15,FNorth and West Northamptonshire
OL,16,Fcouncils said they made the "difficult
OL,17,Fdecision" to postpone as predicted
OL,18,Fconditions could pose a risk to
OL,19,Fvisitors, staff and exhibitors.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
